    },
    "notes": {
        "e2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": -256,
            "width": 560,
            "height": 320,
            "content": "## @apx-vero mention -> Claude mention responder\n\nStarts `.github/workflows/claude-mention-responder.yml` when a person mentions the bot on a PR — in the conversation, inline on a diff line, or in a review body.\n\nA GitHub notification is one per PR thread, so the payload is only `{pr_url}`: the workflow sweeps that PR for every mention with no reply yet and answers each once.\n\n**Source of truth:** `.github/appmixer-flows/apx-vero-mention-dispatch.json` in the connectors repo."
        },
        "e2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": 256,
            "width": 560,
            "height": 272,
            "content": "### Two accounts\n\n**New Mention** reads the notifications of the account it is bound to, so bind the **bot** (apx-vero) — its own mentions never notify it, which also rules out loops.\n\n**Repository Dispatch** needs **push** to the repository; bind a writer. The target repository is the one the mention came from (`repository.full_name`).\n\n403 \"OAuth App access restrictions\" = the org has no grant for the Appmixer GitHub app; after granting, re-authorize the account."
        }
    },
    "wizard": {
        "fields": [
            {
                "type": "account",
                "label": "Bot account (the one people mention)",
                "tooltip": "Its notifications are read to find mentions. Bind the bot, e.g. apx-vero.",
                "placeholder": "",
                "attrs": {
                    "service": "appmixer:github",
                    "components": [
                        "a2000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001"
                    ],
                    "sharedAccountId": null
